# Kept out of GitHub's release source archives, which Zenodo archives as each version:
# editor and coding-agent configuration is not part of the work. Tests, scripts, docs and
# contributor docs stay, so an archive can still rebuild and test its release.
# The PyPI sdist is shaped by MANIFEST.in instead.
.agents/ export-ignore
.claude/ export-ignore
.cursor/ export-ignore
.vscode/ export-ignore
AGENTS.md export-ignore
CLAUDE.md export-ignore
